WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.960
Night.

2
00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:06.840
A mansion blazing with light, and a
lawn full of party guests, whispering.

3
00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:10.770
Rumours float up from the
crowd: that "he killed a man",

4
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.370
that he was "a German spy".

5
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:17.190
The stranger sitting beside the
narrator turns out to be the host.

6
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.190
"I’m Gatsby," he says.

7
00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:20.410
So which is he?

8
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:23.970
A great romantic, or
just a liar and a crook?

9
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:28.320
In this mission, you'll see why the
rumours arrive before the man does.

10
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:33.510
You'll meet James Gatz of North Dakota,
the farm boy who invented Jay Gatsby.

11
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.280
And you'll put Nick's verdict to the test.

12
00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:39.640
Your mission: decide which Gatsby is real.
